{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemunai is a survival horror in which you will accompany Kaito as he faces presences that defy all logic. Reiko sent him a desperate letter asking for help, and now he must traverse a town that feels familiar\u2026 even as every memory becomes distorted in the fog. There is no room for nostalgia, only for surviving once he discovers what Nemunai is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f234a15c1f0d2dc7da643bc576c9a44d.poster.avif?t=1765240437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f234a15c1f0d2dc7da643bc576c9a44d.webm?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with the environment, open routes to new areas, survive, and confront the entities waiting for you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/dc28ff6e4e62e282d6b64512fd6b19cb.poster.avif?t=1765240437\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/dc28ff6e4e62e282d6b64512fd6b19cb.webm?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/dc28ff6e4e62e282d6b64512fd6b19cb.mp4?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the essence of classic survival horror: the atmosphere, the tension, and the nostalgia will do the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/1c381d7c694d94877ff9d345bd1c9f95.poster.avif?t=1765240437\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/1c381d7c694d94877ff9d345bd1c9f95.webm?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/1c381d7c694d94877ff9d345bd1c9f95.mp4?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your adventure your way: fixed cameras, first-person, or third-person. Choose your style, but remember: <br>You can\u2019t run forever. Face your pursuers head-on and prove your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/4121689df0e7065f0ef1c99a1b504044.poster.avif?t=1765240437\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/4121689df0e7065f0ef1c99a1b504044.webm?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/4121689df0e7065f0ef1c99a1b504044.mp4?t=1765240437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, there\u2019s fighting too:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus Mode: choose your character and battle others in a completely different mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati